{
  "id": 10,
  "description": "### Terminal\nThe great calamity approaches. An unceasing horde of enemies who will stop at nothing to destroy us. Backed by the mad kings and betrayer gods, nothing remains in their wake. To fight them is hopeless, to flee from them, heretical.\n  \nThe world&#039;s heroes and champions have long since fallen. Ours is the one force still capable of fighting back. We are simply those who for one reason or another have sworn to fight unto eternity. The final battle is here, but in the end we will remain.\n  \nWe are Terminal.\n  \nTuesdays are bingo nights, we bake cookies and exchange recipes on Fridays.\n  \n\n### Requirements\nAnyone is free to join.\nMembers must be active weekly. \n  \n\n### Socials\nJoining the Discord is highly encouraged but not required of guild members.\n\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/ZZupTBHwbe\n  \n\n### Challenges and Raids\nChallenges and raids are not obligatory, but any participation is appreciated. Everyone can start raids at any time, but they must be scheduled at least 1 hour in advance.",
